mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>本课程系统阐述生物质谱的仪器原理及其在临床疾病诊断与治疗中的前沿应用。课程首先系统讲解质谱核心技术，涵盖离子源、主流质量分析器（如四极杆、飞行时间、傅里叶变换离子回旋共振、静电轨道阱）的原理与串联质谱工作机制。在此基础上，课程重点介绍质谱在蛋白质组学、代谢组学及空间成像中的研究方法与应用实例，并进一步讲解如何整合多组学技术（如核糖体RNA测序、单细胞测序等），结合类器官芯片、生物可视化等交叉方法，系统解析真实世界中的复杂临床问题，从而揭示疾病分子机制，助力诊断标志物与特异性治疗靶点的发现。</p>
<p>课程亦关注质谱技术前沿进展，引入离子迁移谱-质谱联用（TIMS）、数据非依赖采集（DIA）及深度学习等新方法与分析策略，深入剖析单细胞质谱、宏蛋白质组学等在心血管疾病、肿瘤等重大疾病研究中的具体应用与转化潜力。</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:70.8500pt;">
                <td width=205 valign=center colspan=4 style="width:123.1000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal align=center style="text-align:center;"><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">课程简介（英文）</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal align=center style="text-align:center;"><b><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">Course </font></span></b><b><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">Description</span></b><b><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-spacerun:'yes';">&nbsp;</span></span></b><b><span
                                    style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">(</span></b><b><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">in English</font></span></b><b><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">)</span></b><b><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

                </td>
                <td width=572 valign=center colspan=10 style="width:343.6000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course provides a systematic introduction to the fundamental principles of biological mass spectrometry and its cutting-edge applications in the clinical diagnosis and treatment of human diseases. It begins with an in-depth overview of core mass spectrometry technologies, including ionization sources, the operating principles of major mass analyzers (e.g., quadrupole, time-of-flight, Fourier transform ion cyclotron resonance, and Orbitrap), and the working mechanisms of tandem mass spectrometry.</p>
<p>Building on this foundation, the course focuses on methodological frameworks and representative applications of mass spectrometry in proteomics, metabolomics, and spatial molecular imaging. It further explains how to integrate multi-omics approaches (such as rRNA sequencing and single-cell sequencing) with interdisciplinary methodologies—including organ-on-a-chip platforms and biomedical visualization—to systematically interrogate complex real-world clinical questions. Through these integrated strategies, the course highlights how mass spectrometry–enabled multi-omics can illuminate disease molecular mechanisms and facilitate the discovery of diagnostic biomarkers and specific therapeutic targets.</p>
<p>The course also covers emerging advances in the field, introducing ion mobility–mass spectrometry (TIMS), data-independent acquisition (DIA), and deep learning–based analytical strategies. In particular, it examines the applications and translational potential of single-cell mass spectrometry and metaproteomics in major disease areas such as cardiovascular disorders and cancer.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">2.</span></b><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">教学目标</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">/Course Objectives</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Courier New';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">（结合本校办学定位、学生情况、专业人才培养要求，应体现价值引领、知识传授、能力培养等方面的内容。）</font></span><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:63.5500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>本课程主要面向临床医学、基础医学、生物医学、生物化学与分子生物学、化学生物学、分析化学及药学等相关学科的研究生。课程旨在系统讲授质谱分析技术的原理与方法，帮助学生深入理解质谱工作机制，掌握其在生物医学研究中的实际应用策略。学生将通过本课程的学习，获得运用质谱技术独立设计并开展组学实验、解析复杂生物数据的能力，并了解其与测序技术、类器官芯片等前沿方法的结合策略。课程致力于培养学生综合运用多技术手段，系统推进自身研究课题的能力，使其在面对真实科研问题时，能够更精准地设计实验、解读数据，从而提升科研工作的系统性与创新性。</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">3</font></span></b><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span
                                    style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">.</span></b><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">教学方式</font><font
                                        face="Times New Roman">/Teaching Methods</font></span></b><sub><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;
vertical-align:sub;"><font face="仿宋">（应体现实现教学目标所采用的具体策略、方法和组织形式）</font></span></sub><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:66.6500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>本课程采用“理论-技术-应用”三维融合的教学模式，依托复旦大学附属中山医院、生物医学研究院及脑科学转化研究院的跨学科师资团队，由8位长期从事多组学技术与临床转化研究的教授、研究员及副研究员联合主讲。教学注重前沿性、系统性与实践性相结合，具体安排如下：</p>
<ol>
<li>模块化专题讲授：围绕多组学技术核心主题，每位教师负责其专长模块，涵盖质谱原理、蛋白质组学、代谢组学、空间多组学、生物信息学整合分析等，突出技术发展脉络与临床问题驱动的科研逻辑。</li>
</ol>
<ol start="2">
<li>案例驱动的研讨教学：结合主讲团队在心血管疾病、肿瘤、神经疾病等领域的实际研究案例，穿插介绍国内外多组学领域最新突破，组织学生进行案例学习、数据解读与实验设计讨论，培养学生从临床问题出发、运用多组学手段解析疾病机制的能力。</li>
</ol>
<ol start="3">
<li>跨学科交叉研讨：利用师资团队的临床、基础与转化复合背景，组织围绕“临床样本—组学数据—机制验证—转化探索”的跨环节研讨，引导学生建立从基础发现到临床应用的系统性科研思维。</li>
</ol>
<p>通过以上多元教学方式的有机结合，本课程旨在构建一个开放、互动、前沿的学习平台，助力学生掌握多组学技术的整体框架与临床转化路径，为未来开展交叉学科研究奠定扎实基础。</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:22.4500pt;">
